loom ladder_stubs pure_stubs=2315 stub_lines=3 claims=2 claims_adrift=0
file caravan/ladder_checks.rye the lifted body, one published function taking the rung as a comptime type parameter
file caravan/abate.rye one of sixteen rungs whose forty-six-line body became a three-line stub
file caravan/redress.rye read and left whole -- the seventeenth rung, whose report needs no accessor
file tools/fixtures/ladder_stub_length_scan.sh the new refusal -- a harness delegating to itself, named ahead of the measurement
