file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh ceiling ratcheted 73167 -> 72522
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish the two pinned carry lines moved, and the fold-queue prose brought current
file tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish slots advanced -- folded redress_the_meeting, head weigh_the_answer, sibling confirm_pruned
file tools/glow_tend_era_suite.rish rung ten reads the stub count rather than reciting it, and names the third refusal
file crux/REDS.md REDS %132 booked and closed, headline moved to the measured spine at 132
file crux/REMEMBER.md the live card's Now rows refreshed to this lap and the next crux named from the meter
recommend keep-going weigh_the_answer at fourteen identical bodies over fifteen declarations by fifty-one lines -- 624 by realized fall, zero widening, the head the meter names. Open by reading which rung differs and why, exactly as this lap did; the split has come up three laps running and six times across the arc, and it has been meaning every time. Behind it confirm_pruned at 516 over forty-four with all forty-four identical and nothing to widen, then seat_note 504 opening three, read_words 504 opening three, read_count 462 opening three, revoke_one 468 opening forty. elder_waits returns the same 504 while opening all forty-three, so it is the cheapest-looking row that costs the most. The ones that truly cost: choose_pass 630 opening 129, may_pass 574 opening 96, load_one 549 opening 120, read_own_line 492 opening 126. mend_the_plan is spent at 72.
